        ('10021c80', 'ObjectBank<RTexture,NullCS>::AllocVoid', 'func', 'd3d_texture', 'vslot 1 of 10046370: pops the StructBank free list (this+0x1c, refill by 1003b5f0 with the cache size at +0xc) and constructs an RTexture in place; stdlith object_bank.h AllocVoid->Allocate for the 0x4c-byte RTexture bank 100617e8', 'medium', 'exe-decomp'),
